### Test Staff Booking và Weekend Surcharge Features

### 1. Tạo booking cho nhân viên (weekend surcharge tự động tính từ listing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/staff/create
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": "{{propertyId}}",
  "listingId": "{{listingId}}",
  "guestId": "{{guestId}}",
  "checkInDate": "2024-02-15",
  "checkOutDate": "2024-02-17",
  "guests": 2,
  "infants": 0,
  "guest_name": "Nguyễn Văn A",
  "guest_email": "guest@example.com",
  "guest_phone": "0123456789",
  "specialRequests": "Yêu cầu dọn phòng sớm",
  "note": "Khách hàng VIP",
  "additionalCost": 50000,
  "additionalCostReason": "Phí dọn dẹp thêm",
  "status": "confirmed",
  "payment_status": "unpaid",
  "skip_availability_check": false,
  "services": [
    {
      "serviceId": "{{serviceId}}",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 2. Tạo booking với voucher (weekend surcharge tự động từ listing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/staff/create
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": "{{propertyId}}",
  "listingId": "{{listingId}}",
  "checkInDate": "2024-02-20",
  "checkOutDate": "2024-02-22",
  "guests": 3,
  "infants": 1,
  "guest_name": "Trần Thị B",
  "guest_email": "guest2@example.com",
  "guest_phone": "0987654321",
  "voucherCode": "SUMMER2024",
  "status": "pending",
  "payment_status": "unpaid"
}

### 3. Cập nhật weekend surcharge cho listing
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/listings/{{listingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "has_weekend_surcharge": true,
  "weekend_surcharge_percent": 20
}

### 4. Tạo booking với giá tùy chỉnh
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/staff/create
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": "{{propertyId}}",
  "listingId": "{{listingId}}",
  "checkInDate": "2024-02-25",
  "checkOutDate": "2024-02-27",
  "guests": 2,
  "guest_name": "Lê Văn C",
  "guest_email": "guest3@example.com",
  "guest_phone": "0123456789",
  "price_per_night": 800000,
  "final_amount": 2000000,
  "status": "confirmed",
  "payment_status": "paid",
  "skip_availability_check": true
}

### 5. Test validation - Không có quyền
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/staff/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": "{{propertyId}}",
  "listingId": "{{listingId}}",
  "checkInDate": "2024-02-15",
  "checkOutDate": "2024-02-17",
  "guests": 2,
  "guest_name": "Test User",
  "guest_email": "test@example.com"
}

### 6. Test validation - Property không tồn tại
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/staff/create
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
  "listingId": "{{listingId}}",
  "checkInDate": "2024-02-15",
  "checkOutDate": "2024-02-17",
  "guests": 2,
  "guest_name": "Test User",
  "guest_email": "test@example.com"
}

### 7. Lấy booking với thông tin weekend surcharge (tự động tính)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{propertyId}}/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Lấy listing với thông tin weekend surcharge
GET {{baseUrl}}/listings/{{listingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Variables cho test
# @baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
# @authToken = your_jwt_token_here
# @propertyId = your_property_id_here
# @listingId = your_listing_id_here
# @bookingId = your_booking_id_here
# @guestId = your_guest_id_here
# @serviceId = your_service_id_here 